# Tenant databases, directory.db -- never committed, per-deployment state.
# data/demo/ specifically: generated synthetic demo data (datagen/), can be
# large (the 3,000-item/4-year demo set is ~25MB of CSVs) and is
# regenerable from datagen/v1/generera_lagerdata.py with a fixed seed --
# no reason to version it. Real/anonymised customer data must never be
# committed either (docs/FORECAST_SPEC.md working agreement) -- this same
# data/ exclusion covers that too, since it is the one place either kind
# of data lives.
data/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
